# Measurement outputs. The measurement instruments and the run schedule are
# tracked so that others can reproduce the campaign; the figures a run produces
# are reported in the dissertation rather than committed here. The .gitkeep
# entries are kept so the directories exist before the runs.
/evidence/criterion/*
!/evidence/criterion/.gitkeep
/evidence/sizes/*
!/evidence/sizes/.gitkeep
/evidence/correctness-gate-*.md

# Environment manifests identify a specific machine. They are kept locally and
# reproduced in the dissertation instead.
/evidence/manifests/*
!/evidence/manifests/.gitkeep

# Harness diff and equivalence checks are deliberately not ignored. Chapter 4
# admits a harness commit only on the archived evidence that it leaves protocol
# code unchanged, so /evidence/harness-diffs/ is tracked.

# Byproduct of running the vendored crate's tests standalone; outside the
# harness scope.
/third-party/hqc-kem/Cargo.lock
